{% comment %}
  Warranty page — native rebuild of the live /warranty page (audit target:
  live capture 2026-09-18). On the live site this page has NO AKDY-built
  content of its own: the entire body below the breadcrumb is a single
  NetSuite "External Lead Page" form (Online Lead Form, compid 4480470,
  formid 15), embedded as a 100% x 1000px iframe:

    https://4480470.extforms.netsuite.com/app/site/crm/externalleadpage.nl
      ?compid=4480470&formid=15&h=AACffht_ahwg81YSO1rpG2Lwjqi00s7tyVg

  That form is the live warranty-registration workflow (first/last name,
  email, phone, address, city, state, zip, country, PID, order number,
  purchase date, "where did you purchase?" — all POSTing straight into
  AKDY's NetSuite CRM as a lead). Keeping the same iframe here is
  deliberate: it is the fastest, lowest-risk migration (the form keeps
  working exactly as it does today, same backend, zero data-migration
  decision needed) and gives pixel-for-pixel parity with the live page.

  The iframe URL is a section setting, not hardcoded, so it can be swapped
  without a code change if NetSuite ever reissues the form's `h` token or
  Min wants to point it at a different form.

  If a native Shopify-side form is ever wanted instead (no NetSuite call),
  the full field list to rebuild is documented in
  docs/policy-page-content/warranty-form-fields.md — pulled directly from
  the live NetSuite form so nothing has to be re-captured.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="container">
  {% render 'breadcrumbs' %}

  <div class="warranty">
    <h1 class="page-title sr-only">{{ page.title }}</h1>

    {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="warranty-intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.form_url != blank -%}
      <iframe
        class="warranty-form-frame"
        src="{{ section.settings.form_url }}"
        title="{{ section.settings.form_title | default: 'AKDY Warranty Registration' }}"
        width="100%"
        height="{{ section.settings.form_height | default: 1000 }}"
        loading="lazy">
      </iframe>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="warranty-form-missing" data-todo="warranty-form-url">Warranty registration form is not configured yet.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Warranty",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro text",
      "info": "Optional AKDY-side copy above the form. The live page has none — the NetSuite form has its own banner/intro baked in — so this is blank by default."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "form_url",
      "label": "Warranty form embed URL",
      "default": "https://4480470.extforms.netsuite.com/app/site/crm/externalleadpage.nl?compid=4480470&formid=15&h=AACffht_ahwg81YSO1rpG2Lwjqi00s7tyVg",
      "info": "The live NetSuite lead-form URL. Same backend as today — swap this if the form is ever rebuilt or the link token changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "form_title",
      "label": "Iframe accessible title",
      "default": "AKDY Warranty Registration"
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "form_height",
      "label": "Iframe height (px)",
      "default": 1000,
      "info": "Matches the live embed's fixed height (1000px)."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Warranty"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
